# Enterprise HIE Interoperability & Value Realization Strategy

## Executive Summary
This repository outlines an enterprise-level strategy for evaluating and operationalizing a Health Information Exchange (HIE) rollout across a 4-hospital network and integrated ambulatory clinics. The primary focus is to align governance, interoperability standards, clinical workflow redesign, and financial value realization into a cohesive implementation roadmap.

The primary objective is to transition fragmented clinical workflows into a connected care model that reduces redundant diagnostic testing, lowers 30-day readmission rates, and improves patient safety through more timely access to complete, trusted clinical information.

